              <li><strong>Pauli Exclusion Principle:</strong> Max 2 electrons per orbital, opposite spins</li>
              <li><strong>Hund's Rule:</strong> Fill degenerate orbitals singly (same spin) before pairing</li>
              <li>Orbital capacities: s = 2e&minus;, p = 6e&minus;, d = 10e&minus;, f = 14e&minus;</li>
