              <li><strong>Cu:</strong> [Ar] 3d&sup1;&sup0; 4s&sup1; (not 3d&sup9; 4s&sup2;) — fully-filled d is stable</li>
              <li>When forming cations, <strong>remove s electrons first</strong> before d electrons</li>
