            <h4 style="color:var(--gold);">Energy Profiles</h4>
            <ul style="font-size:0.88em; line-height:1.7;">
              <li><strong>Activation energy (E<sub>a</sub>):</strong> Minimum energy required to start a reaction (reactants &rarr; transition state)</li>
              <li><strong>&Delta;H = E<sub>products</sub> &minus; E<sub>reactants</sub>:</strong> Negative = exothermic, Positive = endothermic</li>
              <li><strong>Transition state:</strong> Highest energy point; unstable, cannot be isolated</li>
              <li><strong>E<sub>a(reverse)</sub> = E<sub>a(forward)</sub> &minus; &Delta;H</strong> for exothermic reactions</li>
            </ul>
