      <div class="learning-goal"><strong>AP Connection:</strong> Predict the sign of ΔS based on changes in disorder (Topic 9.1). Calculate ΔG = ΔH − TΔS and determine spontaneity at different temperatures (Topics 9.2–9.3). Find the crossover temperature where spontaneity changes (Topic 9.4).</div>

      <details class="how-to-use"><summary>How to Use This Tool</summary><div class="how-to-content">
