      <div class="learning-goal"><strong>AP Connection:</strong> Calculate K from ΔG° using ΔG° = −RT ln K (Topic 9.5). Understand that ΔG° < 0 means K > 1 (product-favored) and ΔG° > 0 means K < 1 (reactant-favored) (Topics 9.6–9.7). Relate thermodynamics to equilibrium position.</div>

      <details class="how-to-use"><summary>How to Use This Tool</summary><div class="how-to-content">
