          <li><strong>Set ΔG°</strong> using the slider — negative values correspond to product-favored reactions (K > 1), positive to reactant-favored (K < 1).</li>
          <li><strong>Adjust Temperature</strong> to see how T affects the relationship between ΔG° and K.</li>
